# Frame story: Theo (22) gets his first real paycheck and spends one evening at Nana June's kitchen table (she was a bank teller for 41 years).
# lines: (speaker, text). N = narrator. Cast all made up: THEO, NANA, + regulars PIP, DOT, WENDELL, GUS, MABEL.
# Numbers checked 15 Nov 2026, see 06-Basic-Financial-Concepts-sources.md.
