dict(id='B49', act=11, card="Your Wallet"),
dict(id='B50', act=11, set='nana6', vis='Back in Nana\'s kitchen, near midnight. Ten index cards laid out. Theo has written a plan on the back of the paystub.',
  lines=[('N', "So here are the ten ideas, as one plan for your own wallet. Know where your paycheck goes before it arrives. Keep your cash in an insured bank, and a few months of bills saved for the day the party stops. Kill any debt charging you twenty percent. Pay every bill on time, so your score works for you. And put something, even small, into a low-cost, broad fund, as early as you can, then leave it alone. Inflation is working against money that sits still. Time works for money that moves.")]),
